[statement]
A requirement on a name binds every package providing it, one providing it
at no version included: asked for `x=1.0` and for `p1`, which provides `x`
at no version, apk refuses.

[repository]
P:x
V:1.0

P:p1
V:1
p:x
k:5


[request]
x=1.0
p1

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   p1-1:
|     breaks: world[x=1.0]
|     satisfies: world[p1]
refused
